HR Analytics SQL Project
============================================================

Description:
This project contains 20 SQL queries performed on an HR employee dataset.
It demonstrates core SQL concepts such as GROUP BY, HAVING,
Subqueries, Correlated Subqueries, CASE statements,
Window Functions, Ranking logic, and Percentage calculations.

The goal is to analyze employee data to generate insights related
to salary, attrition, department performance, experience, and promotions.
This project is designed for SQL interview preparation and data analytics practice.
============================================================
